  "officialHtml": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/puc1600.html",
  "prefLabel": "Puc 1603.02 New Franchises; When to File Tariffs",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 1603.02 New Franchises; When to File Tariffs.\n\n(a) At the time of proposing an initial franchise, a utility shall file a proposed tariff with the commission.\n\n(b) When the commission approves the terms of a utility franchise pursuant to Puc 200, the utility shall file a tariff with the commission which complies with the terms approved.\n\n(c) Once a utility franchise is established, the utility shall at all times maintain on file with the commission a tariff that accurately reflects any revisions to the tariff.\n\nSource. #14030, eff 7-25-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/puc1600.html"
}
